<title>LUXEMBOURG: TENNIS-LUXEMBOURG WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LUXEMBOURG WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $164,250</p>
<p>Luxembourg Women's Tennis Championship on Thursday.</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) beat Barbara Schett (Austria) 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Anne Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Patty Schnyder (Switserland)</p>
<p>6-1 6-0</p>
<p>Anke Huber (Germany) beat Alexandra Olsza (Poland) 6-3 1-6 6-0</p>
</text>
